    --------
    >>> close = 10.0 10.5 10.2 10.8 11.1 10.9 11.4 11.8 11.5 12.0 12.3 12.1

    nbdev=0.5：
    >>> tail(ts_talib_var(close, 3, 0.5), 3)
    [0.0422222, 0.108889, 0.0155556]

