    [0.0422222, 0.108889, 0.0155556]

    nbdev=2.0：
    >>> tail(ts_talib_var(close, 3, 2.0), 3)
    [0.0422222, 0.108889, 0.0155556]
    */
    return ta::var(col, int(time_period), nbdev)
}

