    time_period=2：
    >>> tail(ts_talib_wma(close, 2), 3)
    [11.8333, 12.2, 12.1667]

    time_period=3：
    >>> tail(ts_talib_wma(close, 3), 3)
    [11.8, 12.0667, 12.15]

    time_period=5：
    >>> tail(ts_talib_wma(close, 5), 3)
    [11.6733, 11.9333, 12.0333]
    */
