    >>> ts_unary_rolling_count(col, 3, int(NULL))
    [NULL, NULL, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]

    min_periods=1 时首个有效观测即可产生结果：
    >>> ts_unary_rolling_count(col, 3, 1)
